      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross release of technical reserves of $89.2m in 2023, driven primarily by favourable claims development across prior years, notably in the Casualty, Marine and Treaty portfolios. The release follows a period of prior-year strengthening (notably in response to inflationary concerns in 2022) and existing exposures remain to major prior events including the Russia/Ukraine crisis, Covid-19 and Hurricane Ian. Several 2023 events (Cyclone Gabrielle, Auckland Floods, Hawaii Wildfires, Israel/Gaza conflict) produced claims but were quantified and reported separately in the technical reserves note.",
